      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We're now six months further, and not a single word has been said about giving world creators any of the SDK components. Kind of a shame in my opinion, because Steam Audio is super cool when you can use its features.\n\nPretty sure it was initially requested for what it's capable of, and not just to improve the voice system of VRC.\n\nI get the VRC Team has a lot on their plate already, but I really hope we'll get any kind of update on this sometime soon as I'd love to use it in my world. And I'm sure there are plenty of other world creators who feel the same.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
