        "like": 3
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel like being a creator in VRChat is difficult. You want to build your creative ideas on their awesome platform but have to pay the price by being hit over the head with a cinder block every 5 minutes by the lack of features.\n\nI respect y'all on the team so much for being such a small team, and hosting such a complicated and large community. I'm sure its a lot as is.\n\nI can also, however, feel frustrated when I want to create more immersive content on your platform, and instead feel like I'm forced in to the stone-age era due to lack of implementation. It makes me really discouraged to be a creator, and continue playing, creating, and enjoying myself on the platform- which in turn just makes me sad :( \n\nNot seeing features like the ones mentioned in announcements and posts, or built in solutions to issues like this: https://vrclibrary.com/wiki/books/inprogress-multi-channel-live-audio-streams/page/guide/revisions/639\n\nto audio especially, pains me, because there is so many things I'd create BETTER if these tools were implemented and given. \n\nI really employ for the team to do an over haul in features like this, its desperately needed and has been asked for 6+ years. It would be beyond appreciated for me, and others I'd assume.\n\n<3",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
